    "detailed_description": "<h1>LIVE ON KICKSTARTER - SUPPORT INDIE DEVELOPERS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/132a1ba563e7832a1bd9e85b2fe305fe.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Build Your Perfect Dice</strong> \u2013 Equip gear to shape your rolls and define your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Explore a World That Changes Every Run</strong> \u2013 No two journeys are the same\u2014adapt and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2694\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Master Tactical Dice Combat</strong> \u2013 Roll, reroll, and outthink your enemies in every fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\ude82\u00a0<strong>Embark on Risky Expeditions</strong> \u2013 Face shifting dangers, lost secrets, and unexpected encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u26fa\u00a0<strong>Survive the Wilds</strong> \u2013 Manage your camp, ration supplies, and push your luck to go further.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/4cb7a0c2edaca97cdeabccbb020e8c04.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sigilfarer is a roguelite adventure</strong> where <strong>every decision rests on the roll of your dice</strong>. Set in a world forever changed by a magical cataclysm, you lead a group of wanderers through dangerous, uncharted landscapes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the core of Sigilfarer is its unique dice-building system, reimagining deck-building mechanics into something fresh and dynamic. </strong>Your party is your dice set\u2014each weapon, shield, and armor piece you equip transforms your dice, defining the attacks, buffs, and abilities at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/79bdf1302a200420577d38f2d825816a.poster.avif?t=1755004807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/79bdf1302a200420577d38f2d825816a.webm?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/79bdf1302a200420577d38f2d825816a.mp4?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/733190ae4deae87e16030954eecb53aa.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sigilfarer</strong> reimagines the deck-building genre, allowing you to <strong>shape your own destiny with a customizable dice system</strong>. <strong>Your party is the dice set</strong>; each sword, shield, and armor you equip becomes a die face, determining the attacks, buffs, and strategic options available to you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage up to four characters in your team, <strong>creating unique builds and synergies tailored to your playstyle</strong>. The dice are crucial during the whole playthrough and represent abilities of the party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/2ec973d8067adc667288621ab6b24880.poster.avif?t=1755004807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/2ec973d8067adc667288621ab6b24880.webm?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/2ec973d8067adc667288621ab6b24880.mp4?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Roll your dice in <strong>tactical turn-based combat</strong>, use them to overcome skill checks and to renew resources while resting. Every dice throw can turn the tide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/8bab6d4570bf16c55a8d83007602a4ce.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>roguelite adventure</strong>, you'll rely on your wits and the dice you craft to explore procedurally generated, open hexagonal maps. <strong>Each region presents diverse biomes, perils, and opportunities</strong>. Conducted runs will push you to develop your strategy and enhance your dice set with each attempt. <strong>Death is not the end, but rather a fresh beginning</strong>, allowing you to become stronger and wiser with each journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/c919506cb912f40758dd4bbc59746014.poster.avif?t=1755004807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/c919506cb912f40758dd4bbc59746014.webm?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/c919506cb912f40758dd4bbc59746014.mp4?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/f05dbc044405dc3f94034dfd9952f041.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a group of wanderers who traverse a world that was changed by a magical cataclysm. Journeys remain a difficult task, made feasible only by magical sigils that guard caravans from creatures and waves of wild magic. <strong>Plan your journey, manage your resources, and fight for your place in the corrupted world of magic. </strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does Sigilfarer offer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Roguelite Gameplay Loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dice Rolling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Engaging Story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Little Bit of Luck </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Replay Value</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many unlockables and more to come </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric Gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lot of goblins and other creatures </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does Sigilfarrer NOT offer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relaxing Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4x Strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- City Building</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/bd8fa56f683e7ad7cfb8ed3edf20c727.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/4cb7a0c2edaca97cdeabccbb020e8c04.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sigilfarer is a roguelite adventure</strong> where <strong>every decision rests on the roll of your dice</strong>. Set in a world forever changed by a magical cataclysm, you lead a group of wanderers through dangerous, uncharted landscapes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the core of Sigilfarer is its unique dice-building system, reimagining deck-building mechanics into something fresh and dynamic. </strong>Your party is your dice set\u2014each weapon, shield, and armor piece you equip transforms your dice, defining the attacks, buffs, and abilities at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/79bdf1302a200420577d38f2d825816a.poster.avif?t=1755004807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/79bdf1302a200420577d38f2d825816a.webm?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/79bdf1302a200420577d38f2d825816a.mp4?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/733190ae4deae87e16030954eecb53aa.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sigilfarer</strong> reimagines the deck-building genre, allowing you to <strong>shape your own destiny with a customizable dice system</strong>