"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/c919506cb912f40758dd4bbc59746014.poster.avif?t=1755004807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/c919506cb912f40758dd4bbc59746014.webm?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/c919506cb912f40758dd4bbc59746014.mp4?t=1755004807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436870/extras/f05dbc044405dc3f94034dfd9952f041.avif?t=1755004807\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a group of wanderers who traverse a world that was changed by a magical cataclysm. Journeys remain a difficult task, made feasible only by magical sigils that guard caravans from creatures and waves of wild magic. <strong>Plan your journey, manage your resources, and fight for your place in the corrupted world of magic. </strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does Sigilfarer offer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Roguelite Gameplay Loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dice Rolling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Engaging Story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Little Bit of Luck </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Replay Value</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many unlockables and more to come </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric Gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lot of goblins and other creatures </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does Sigilfarrer NOT offer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rel